<p>President Trump was set to meet Japanese Prime Minister Sanae Takaichi at the White House on Thursday as the Iran war, along with fresh strikes on oil and gas facilities in the Persian Gulf, pushed energy markets higher and shifted attention away from what had been expected to be a broader discussion of China and trade. The meeting carried extra weight because Takaichi was the first U.S. ally to visit the White House after Trump asked partners to help patrol the Strait of Hormuz, a vital shipping lane for global energy supplies.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/44K5cN4fZlsZkV2x7wWGtqSfEaBX1JTkp2dhToMBLKdVdFsrToc7mQJ71p0jlQDvhkQ-Etfphdgr3xQJI3w3m8GeRz5QeRQ7qyWSt1xySEowK31ImHrR2j42RRcYsfUHT8nUJ5nZwnwTOrxTgAT9cjSzWhdtOYasnY4IHetl-A0ZkP0t1dkok_aqGLhAmAFxIamRH0oQHfWz' alt='Image associated with New York Times coverage of strikes rattling Gulf energy markets' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Legal limits: Japan and other U.S. allies in East Asia face legal constraints on overseas military deployments, which complicates President Trump&#x27;s request for naval help in the Strait of Hormuz.</li><li>Trade overlap: Semafor reported that Takaichi also had to manage trade tensions with Washington while seeking lower energy costs through an end to the Iran conflict.</li><li>China factor: The South China Morning Post said the meeting was being watched closely for what it could mean for China-Japan ties, especially ahead of the APEC summit later this year.</li><li>Allied reluctance: Semafor said most NATO members had already declined President Trump&#x27;s push to help reopen the Strait of Hormuz, underscoring how limited allied buy-in has been so far.</li></ul><blockquote>We feel it’s important to keep high the attention on Ukraine - one European official</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Trump administration: President Trump has asked allies, including Japan, to send ships to help patrol or reopen the Strait of Hormuz as the conflict threatens energy flows and pushes up fuel prices. (<a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/19/g-s1-114405/japan-takaichi-visit-white-house'>NPR</a>)</li><li>Japanese government: Tokyo saw the meeting as politically sensitive after President Trump criticized Japan for not answering his demands for help in the Strait of Hormuz, making the talks difficult even before they began. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cde4e2xyelpo'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Regional analysts: Observers cited by SCMP see Takaichi&#x27;s meeting with President Trump as an important test of how Japan balances pressure from Washington with worsening relations with China. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3347188/uncompromising-takaichis-meeting-trump-seen-key-china-japan-ties'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>European officials: European officials saw the Iran war as interrupting U.S. efforts to squeeze Russia&#x27;s oil revenue, a shift they viewed as strategically important for Europe. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/as-takaichi-visits-iran-preoccupies-white-house'>Semafor</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/03/19/world/iran-war-news-trump-oil'>Iran War Live Updates: Trump Speaks as Attacks Rattle Energy Markets</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3347188/uncompromising-takaichis-meeting-trump-seen-key-china-japan-ties'>‘Uncompromising’: Takaichi’s meeting with Trump seen as key to China-Japan ties</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/03/19/g-s1-114405/japan-takaichi-visit-white-house'>Japan&#x27;s prime minister visits the White House under shadow of Iran war</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/us-east-asian-allies-in-legal-quandary-as-trump-seeks-help-in-the-middle-east'>US East Asian allies in legal quandary as Trump seeks help in the Middle East</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cde4e2xyelpo'>Japan PM to hold &#x27;difficult&#x27; talks with Trump as Iran conflict looms large</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/japans-pm-faces-highwire-meeting-with-trump'>Japan PM faces highwire meeting with Trump</a> - semafor.com</li></ul>